# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ghars Platform — source control exclusions
#
# Two rules drive this file:
#   1. Build output and IDE state are reproducible, so they are never committed.
#   2. Runtime data (uploaded evidence, generated certificates, protected
#      documents) is operational business data. It is backed up and restored
#      through the procedures in GHARS_PRODUCTION_OPERATIONS.md, NOT through Git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Build output ----------------------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/
*.dll
*.pdb

# --- IDE / editor state ----------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.csproj.user

# --- Local configuration and secrets --------------------------------------
# appsettings.json itself IS committed: it holds only a Windows-authentication
# development connection string with no credentials. Real credentials belong in
# environment variables or .NET User Secrets — see the README.
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.local.json
secrets.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Protected runtime uploads --------------------------------------------
# KPI evidence, organization licences and official survey reports. Deliberately
# stored outside wwwroot and served only through ProtectedFilesController.
# This is live business data and must never enter source control.
protected-uploads/

# --- Public runtime uploads ------------------------------------------------
# wwwroot/uploads holds user- and admin-uploaded content: generated certificate
# PDFs (which carry participant names), library files, gallery and agenda media,
# organization logos and reward images. All of it is runtime data.
#
# The one exception is the sample library PDF that DbSeeder references by a fixed
# path, so a freshly seeded database is not left with a broken link.
/wwwroot/uploads/*
!/wwwroot/uploads/library/
/wwwroot/uploads/library/*
!/wwwroot/uploads/library/sample-ghars-values.pdf

# --- Databases and backups -------------------------------------------------
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.ndf
*.bak
*.trn
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# --- Logs and temporary files ---------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak.*
*~

# --- Agent / tooling session state ----------------------------------------
# Local assistant working memory and transcripts; machine-specific, not project source.
.remember/
.claude/

# --- OS noise --------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
